    "title": "Sales ops agents: how to define permission boundaries before automating revenue work",
    "seoTitle": "Sales ops agents: how to define permission boundaries before automating…",
    "seoDescription": "Sales ops agents is changing AI implementation. ALTOS LAB uses sources, a decision table and a build lens to show how to define permission boundaries…",
    "excerpt": "When Sales ops agents moves from news to operations, teams need a source-backed framework to define permission boundaries before automating revenue work without losing…",
    "contentType": "column",
