    "seoTitle": "Multi-agent collaboration: how to use handoff formats to keep automations…",
    "seoDescription": "Multi-agent collaboration is changing AI implementation. ALTOS LAB uses sources, a decision table and a build lens to show how to use handoff formats to…",
