    "title": "AI crawler log analysis playbook: how to use crawl signals to tune content refresh cadence",
    "seoTitle": "AI crawler log analysis playbook: how to use crawl signals to tune content…",
    "seoDescription": "AI crawler log analysis is changing AI implementation. ALTOS LAB uses sources, a decision table and a build lens to show how to use crawl signals to tune…",
    "excerpt": "When AI crawler log analysis moves from news to operations, teams need a source-backed framework to use crawl signals to tune content refresh cadence without losing…",
    "contentType": "feature",
