    "title": "AI search brand monitoring: how to use a weekly question set to see how the market describes you",
    "seoTitle": "AI search brand monitoring: how to use a weekly question set to see how the…",
    "seoDescription": "AI search brand monitoring is changing AI implementation. ALTOS LAB uses sources, a decision table and a build lens to show how to use a weekly question…",
    "excerpt": "When AI search brand monitoring moves from news to operations, teams need a source-backed framework to use a weekly question set to see how the market describes you…",
    "contentType": "column",
