    "translationGroupId": "tg_market_data-readiness-before-agents_v1",
    "title": "Data readiness before agents playbook: how to fix knowledge boundaries before tool automation",
    "seoTitle": "Data readiness before agents playbook: how to fix knowledge boundaries before…",
    "seoDescription": "Data readiness before agents is changing AI implementation. ALTOS LAB uses sources, a decision table and a build lens to show how to fix knowledge…",
    "excerpt": "When Data readiness before agents moves from news to operations, teams need a source-backed framework to fix knowledge boundaries before tool automation without losing…",
    "contentType": "feature",
