    "title": "Model vendor switching playbook: how to use replaceable architecture to reduce platform lock-in",
    "seoTitle": "Model vendor switching playbook: how to use replaceable architecture to reduce…",
    "seoDescription": "Model vendor switching is changing AI implementation. ALTOS LAB uses sources, a decision table and a build lens to show how to use replaceable…",
