    "title": "Agent user feedback loops playbook: how to route every failure back to knowledge and workflow",
    "seoTitle": "Agent user feedback loops playbook: how to route every failure back to…",
    "seoDescription": "Agent user feedback loops is changing AI implementation. ALTOS LAB uses sources, a decision table and a build lens to show how to route every failure…",
