    "title": "Model routing strategy playbook: how to allocate model cost by task difficulty and risk",
    "seoTitle": "Model routing strategy playbook: how to allocate model cost by task difficulty…",
    "seoDescription": "Model routing strategy is changing AI implementation. ALTOS LAB uses sources, a decision table and a build lens to show how to allocate model cost by…",
