    "title": "Meeting-to-action systems playbook: how to turn notes, tasks and follow-up into AI operations",
    "seoTitle": "Meeting-to-action systems playbook: how to turn notes, tasks and follow-up…",
    "seoDescription": "Meeting-to-action systems is changing AI implementation. ALTOS LAB uses sources, a decision table and a build lens to show how to turn notes, tasks and…",
    "excerpt": "When Meeting-to-action systems moves from news to operations, teams need a source-backed framework to turn notes, tasks and follow-up into AI operations without losing…",
    "contentType": "feature",
    "newsCategory": "Industry workflows",
    "topic": "Meeting-to-action systems",
